    "language": "[0]So what is wrong with this situation is that, um, in reality, I would've found a more open space to receive the ball from my teammate, um, preferably right[1] here or right here,[2] um, so that the teammate isn't, um, impeding, um, the ball's path. Um, and then, yeah, so in this situation, you would try to find an open space, move away from the opponent so that there is a clear path for the teammate to pass the ball to you, and then, um, if the a- if you have enough space, you could turn around and shoot. If not, you can, um, pass it back to the teammate, um, in a better position away from the opponent.",
